{
  "slug": "mnemopay",
  "name": "Mnemopay",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Payment infrastructure for AI agents. Agent Credit Score (300-850), real payment rails\n(Stripe/Paystack/Lightning), autonomous shopping with escrow, hash-chained ledger, and behavioral\nfinance. Charge for tool usage, track spending, shop autonomously, and build agent creditworthiness\nall from Claude Code.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **8 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (8): `balance` (Check the current balance and financial status of an AI agent), `charge` (Charge an AI agent for a service or tool invocation), `fico` (Check the Agent FICO credit score (300-850) and reputation of an AI agent), `history` (View transaction history and financial records), `recall` (Search and retrieve information from the agent's persistent memory), `remember` (Store information in the agent's persistent memory), `settle` (Settle pending transactions and release escrow), `shop` (Search for products and make purchases using autonomous shopping with escrow)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `mnemopay`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install mnemopay@claude-community` from `mnemopay/mnemopay-sdk` (`claude-plugin`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 8,
    "mcp": 1
  },
